/**
 * Performs type inference on a collection of tables, each represented as an ObjDigest with a corresponding name denoted
 * by the ObjDigest's key value in the input. Since PkgInferrer has the context of many tables it can perform
 * higher-level inferences such as foreign key inference. For higher-level inferences results to be significant for
 * String data, the underlying ObjDigests need to be built with a @see ParsingDigestBuilder.
 *
 * @see Digest
 * @see DigestSpec
 * @see ObjDigest
 * @see TypeInferrer
 * @see ValueTypeInferrer
 * @see ForeignKeyInferrer
 * @see ParsingDigestBuilder
 * @see InferValueTypeResult
 */
type PkgInferrer mixes Inferrer<map<string, ObjDigest>, InferPkgResult>
